Z||000000||wxxo||03-27-2000||06:52 PM||||think about it. does everyone really want gm to defile the fiero name by bringing back some contorted version of the original. look at some of the cars that they have brought back recently like the malibu, vw bug etc. they are nothing like the original and only help to ruin the good name that these cars now desperately attempt to hold onto. if the fiero was brought back it would never be the same. it would be some crap version of the car with the fiero stamp on it. you would have to tell people that you have the old style fiero to avoid embassasement because the new style would mean the same thing to people as datsun. enjoy what you have and their uniqueness. appreciate the fact that you have a fiero. a car with a name that means many things to many people. the only car whos name can evoke emotion in all who love this them. dont let gm's next abomination take the name FIERO.||||reg||13
