Z||000003||Fformula88||03-27-2000||08:21 PM||||I wouldn't worry too much about the Fiero name appearing on any GM products any time soon.  Those names that they are returning were largely successful cars, which are now widely revered.  Now, I love my Fiero and think its great, but the overall opinion of our cars isn't that good.  Everyone I know or meet, upon hearing that I have a Fiero, respond with some comment on them being a fire hazard.  GM won't attach a name to a car people think will burn up.  Your as likely to see Corvair attached to a new Chevy as Fiero on a new Pontiac.  Just my $.02.||||reg||1
